    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Laáwi oo gadiyér xuumár afkú Doó Mungú gaa tleehh a kwí: Doó Korawo a Meshelemia garmoó Kore, oo guruú doó Asafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meshelemia daaqaaywós a kwí faanqw: Oo baris a Sekaria, oo tsár a Yediaeli, oo tám a Sebadia, oo tsiyáhh a Yatnieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo kooán a Elamu, oo lahhoó' a Yehohanani nee oo faanqw Eliehoenai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heeko wák i deer umuuwós an Obed-edomu, inós daaqaaywós a kwí: Oo baris a Shemaya, oo tsár a Yehosabadi, oo tám a Yoa, oo tsiyáhh a Sakari, oo kooán a Netaneli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo lahhoó' a Amieli, oo faanqw a Isakari nee oo dakaát a Peuletai. Asma inós kuna tsuúq nee Mungú.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garmaawós kudá' ta bay Shemaya, daaqaay guna laqwaál oo baaliliím baraá guruú doó baabuúine, asma a hhawaataá /uureemaá koomá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Shemaya a kwí: Otni nee Refaeli, nee Obedi, nee Elisabadi, inós hhaeewós kudá' /uureemaá koomá', nee Elihu nee Semakia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' sleémeero a na/aá Obed-edomu, inooín nee na/ii'ine nee hhaeeine, a múk ilakaaharén oo gadiyeérí ga aleesláw. Múk guruú doó Obed-edomu dinkwaaro a mibeeri lahhoó' nee tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meshelemia daaqaywós nee hhaeewose awa /uureemaá koomá' ngi kon mibaá nee dakaát.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hosa a garmoó wák baraá daaqoó Merariwo, inós daaqaay gu kón. Shimri baabuúwós guna uráy haniís tam na/oó barsuwokahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilkia a garmoó tsár doó Hosawo, oo tám a Tebalia, nee oo tsiyáhh a Sekaria. Daaqaay sleémeero oo doó Hosa dinkwaaro nee hhaeewose a mibaá nee tám. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xuumuuseerír afér do' kana qasmiís baraá daqooráy ar adoodá' maray'ín i dirii'iya', inooín sleeme kina baalaqaasírí sláy baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ adoodár hhaeeín awa hatlá' wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsawdo kari tleéhh ar gur'ér maraá baabi'i, muu burku úr laqaá ku niiná, sleémeero a adór wák, umuú heewo afkú do' guna xún. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsawdór geera a afkú bihhaá da/aáw xuuma, Shelemia guna sleér, nee garmaawós Sekaria, kudá' muu i daharií lehhaahhiti, afkú bihhaá /iya gway sláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obed-edomu tsawdo guri sleér, bihhaá basa ngiwa xun, daaqaywós doó xooslár dimbadiimbé koóm gun xún. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shupimu nee Hosa tsawdór afkú /uwa oo Shaleketi gay sleér, didár gáwtí tsa/a/amto, didae xuuma kana baalaqaamiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xuumuusér tlahhoó Laáwi a lahhoó' umuú baalaaro, bihhaá /iiko a tsiyáhh umuú baalaaro, nee basko a tsiyáhh umuú baalaaro, dír do'odá' xooslár dimbadiimbé kooma muu ku qamin tsár umuú baalaaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoodár xaftidár bihhaá /uwawo, baraá loohidá' ure xuumuuse a tsiyáhh, nee dír xaftidár kilae xuumuuse a tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí an adoodá' baalaqaasír xuuma kara tlehhiít dír tla/ángw múk guruú doó Kora nee oo doó Merariwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá tlahhoó Laáwiwo Ahiya kuna qaás, peésár doó Mungú ngiwa amohhe'eemisi nee xoosladá' taa dákw i qaás as gadiyér doó Mungú sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ladani, heé hhay Gershoni inós dír muu bahh'alehe a aakooín, baraá tla/angw'ine bahh'ale a xwaylár garmaawós kudá' ta bay, Yehieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na/aá hatlá' awa tsár awa Yehieli a Setamu nee Yoeli kina qaás as peésár doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngiwa amohhe'eemisiya'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleeme gadiyeé kari qasmiís dír tlahh'aá Siria nee Ishari nee Hebroni nee Usieli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shebueli garmoó Gershoni, garmoó Mose, inós an geeraharusmoó úr oo mukduú peésár Doó Mungú ga amohhe'eemamiís, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee hhiyaawós Elieseri kudá' baabuúwós ta bay Rehabia, Elieseri Yeshaya guri laqwaál, Yoram Sikri guri laqwaál, nee Sikri Shelomoti guri laqwaál. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shelomotiwí nee hhaeewós kina qaás tawa múk peésár doó Mungú ga amohhe'eemiís, nee xoosladá' sleémeero tidá' waawutmo Daudi aa paraátl as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, inós nee geeraharuusér tlahhi'i, nee geeraharuusér kume, nee ar tsiire, nee geeraharuusér slaqwaruuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
