          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xooslaarír haasaáng naa baraá slaqwarár hayoohiyé' kay bahh paraátl as kawa gadiyér Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚR tleehhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mura' sleémeero oo taa paraátl nee Samueliduú iigu'utusmo nee Saulo garmoó Kishi, nee Abneri garmoó Neri, nee Yoabu garmoó Seruya, muruuwí kun xún nee Shelomoti nee hhaeewós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
