          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá daaqoó Hebroniwo, Hashabia nee hhaeewós awa kumuú wák nee tsiire faanqw hhawaataá aleesleemuú koomá', kina qaás as múk Israeli kuduú bihhaá /uwa yaaér Yordaniro, kuwa sagesihhiiti daanduú gadiyér AAKOÓ MUNGUHE nee gadiyér doó waawutmo Daudiwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeria a geeraharusmoó múk guruú doó Hebroni. Qoomár kurkú mibeeri tsiyáhh oo waawuti'iimár Daudi múk aleesleemuú koóm kuri leeleéhh, kuri baraá Yeserír wa sláy tidár baraá yaamaá Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Daudi Yeriya nee hhaeewós awa kume tsár tsiire faanqw, kudá' aleesleemuú koomá', giri qaás, inooín a geeraharuusér tlahhi'i, as muruú Mungú wa hariím nee waawutmo, nguwa sagesihhimitiya' dír múk tlahhoó Reubeni nee oo Gadi nee tlaqtá tlahhoó Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.32"
            ]
          }
        }
